From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Myrrh Periwinkle <myrrhperiwinkle@qtmlabs.xyz>
Date: Tue, 17 Jun 2025 10:42:46 +0700
Subject: Implement EGL_ANGLE_platform_angle_device_id on Linux

This allows the Chromium Ozone/Wayland backend to specify the specific
device that should be used for the EGL surfaceless display. This is
useful for ensuring that ANGLE use the same underlying GPU as the GBM
device for OzoneImageBacking to avoid accidental cross-device resource
sharing.

